# Exercise 03: Interface & recap - Todo List

- [ ] Implement `AMateria` abstract class
    - [ ] Protected attribute: `std::string type`
    - [ ] Constructor with type, Copy constructor, Destructor
    - [ ] `std::string const & getType() const`
    - [ ] Pure virtual function: `virtual AMateria* clone() const = 0`
    - [ ] Virtual function: `virtual void use(ICharacter& target)`
- [ ] Implement `Ice` class (inherits from AMateria)
    - [ ] Type: "ice"
    - [ ] `clone()` returns a new Ice object
    - [ ] `use()` prints " * shoots an ice bolt at <name> * "
- [ ] Implement `Cure` class (inherits from AMateria)
    - [ ] Type: "cure"
    - [ ] `clone()` returns a new Cure object
    - [ ] `use()` prints " * heals <name>’s wounds * "
- [ ] Implement `ICharacter` interface
    - [ ] Pure virtual: `getName()`, `equip(AMateria*)`, `unequip(int)`, `use(int, ICharacter&)`
- [ ] Implement `Character` class (implements ICharacter)
    - [ ] Name attribute
    - [ ] Inventory of 4 AMateria pointers
    - [ ] Handle deep copy for inventory
    - [ ] Handle `equip`, `unequip`, `use` logic
- [ ] Implement `IMateriaSource` interface
    - [ ] Pure virtual: `learnMateria(AMateria*)`, `createMateria(std::string const &)`
- [ ] Implement `MateriaSource` class (implements IMateriaSource)
    - [ ] Inventory of 4 learned AMaterias
    - [ ] Handle deep copy
    - [ ] `learnMateria()` copies the materia passed as parameter
    - [ ] `createMateria()` returns a clone of a previously learned materia
- [ ] Create a `main.cpp` using the subject's example test
- [ ] Verify memory management (very important here because of many news/deletes)
- [ ] Ensure Makefile is present and works
